/// Excel's chart colour-style and chart style parts, written beside every
/// chart of the gallery workbook so Excel draws the chart as its own default
/// chart.
///
/// Both are the parts of the owner's
/// `packages/jet_charts_core/test/fixtures/owner/axis_full/chart_defaults.xlsx`,
/// a workbook Excel for Mac 16.114.4 saved, unchanged: `xl/charts/colors1.xml`
